itle":"Gangstas","overview":"On the streets of Antwerp, Badia, Junes and Volt are trying to tear themselves away from their past, but the underworld is inexorably pulling them back in. Adamo has worked his way up to become one of the most influential figures in the Antwerp drug trade. He becomes ever more entangled in a web of power and danger. His friends have to make a choice: stay loyal to Adamo or choose safety."},{"language":"nl-NL","overview":"5 jaar na de gebeurtenissen van Patser is Adamo nog sterker betrokken bij de cocaïnehandel die het Antwerpse stadsleven meer en meer teistert. Zijn jeugdvrienden zijn op het rechte pad en weigeren alle contact met hem. Jana, de nieuwe chef van de KALI drugseenheid zit hem op de hielen en een combinatie van overmoed en persoonlijke problemen lijken het einde te betekenen van Adamo’s succesformule. Wanneer iemand dicht bij hen overlijdt door een zoveelste aanslag komen de patsers terug samen, met maar één doel voor ogen: wraak.","tagline":"NEXT LEVEL SH*T!"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jeOFoXIszN3gj87CR01W36E3ohR.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jeOFoXIszN3gj87CR01W36E3ohR.png","language":"en","width":3840,"height":1155},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pR9h9Lcbkmcn2zQE3WUASs9fzce.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pR9h9Lcbkmcn2zQE3WUASs9fzce.png","language":"nl","width":3840,"height":1155}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kn7Rh0CnfsH1LhijZIOTu4zUmLB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kn7Rh0CnfsH1LhijZIOTu4zUmLB.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/924LPcY5xq8IWGtFYckxRm2j0uI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/924LPcY5xq8IWGtFYckxRm2j0uI.jpg","language":"nl","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jcw2vCC6p57CmW7KCKhhco5fAfn.jpg